    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hayden's Odyssey</strong> : Break Through the Dimensions and Face the Unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Hayden, a brilliant scientist drawn into a mysterious interdimensional portal. Plunged into unpredictable chaos, you'll have to traverse strange and hostile dimensions, each filled with ever-more formidable dangers, puzzles and enemies. Can you survive this scientific odyssey and find your way home?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 A thrilling roguelike: Discover procedurally generated levels offering unique challenges every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2697\ufe0f An ingenious hero: Use Hayden's skills to take on hordes of enemies and solve complex situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Each level features a distinct aesthetic and atmosphere, ranging from a futuristic laboratory to lush natural environments to totally surreal dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f An evolving arsenal: Collect a multitude of items to strengthen Hayden and face increasingly powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Meticulous art direction: Immerse yourself in a variety of settings, combining modern, dark and fantastical textures to enhance immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Captivating soundtrack: Let yourself be carried away by dynamic music tailored to each dimension and situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenge at every portal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its demanding yet rewarding gameplay, Hayden's Odyssey will put your reflexes and strategic sense to the test.<br>Fans of roguelikes, exploration and science fiction will find here an adventure that lives up to their expectations.<br>Get ready to travel from portal to portal in a universe where every choice can be decisive.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hayden's Odyssey</strong> : Break Through the Dimensions and Face the Unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Hayden, a brilliant scientist drawn into a mysterious interdimensional portal. Plunged into unpredictable chaos, you'll have to traverse strange and hostile dimensions, each filled with ever-more formidable dangers, puzzles and enemies. Can you survive this scientific odyssey and find your way home?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 A thrilling roguelike: Discover procedurally generated levels offering unique challenges every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2697\ufe0f An ingenious hero: Use Hayden's skills to take on hordes of enemies and solve complex situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Each level features a distinct aesthetic and atmosphere, ranging from a futuristic laboratory to lush natural environments to totally surreal dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f An evolving arsenal: Collect a multitude of items to strengthen Hayden and face increasingly powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Meticulous art direction: Immerse yourself in a variety of settings, combining modern, dark and fantastical textures to enhance immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Captivating soundtrack: Let yourself be carried away by dynamic music tailored to each dimension and situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenge at every portal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its demanding yet rewarding gameplay, Hayden's Odyssey will put your reflexes and strategic sense to the test.<br>Fans of roguelikes, exploration and science fiction will find here an adventure that lives up to their expectations.<br>Get ready to travel from portal to portal in a universe where every choice can be decisive.</p>",
    "short_description": "Hayden's Odyssey is a roguelike dungeon crawler where you explore procedurally generated levels, battle a variety of challenging enemies, and collect powerful upgrades. Each run brings new obstacles, ensuring that every journey through the portals is a fresh and intense experience.",
